I'm an accountant in Lagos. I wanted a bill splitter where the shares add up exactly, with no stray kobo. This is what I came up with. What do you think?
```js
const split = (kobo, n) => {
  const base = Math.floor(kobo / n), extra = kobo % n;
  return Array.from({ length: n }, (_, i) => base + (i < extra));
};
split(1000, 3); // [334, 333, 333]
```

I'm a pharmacist in Mumbai and I've started coding for fun. This is my binary search for finding where a value belongs in a sorted list. Could I get your feedback?
```js
const lowerBound = (a, x) => {
  let lo = 0, hi = a.length;
  while (lo < hi) {
    const mid = (lo + hi) >>> 1;
    a[mid] < x ? lo = mid + 1 : hi = mid;
  }
  return lo;
};
```

